\fs36 \cf0 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The ESP32 Waterfall Controller is installed in a NEMA enclosure and is normally administered remotely over Wi-Fi using MicroPython WebREPL.\
Current controller IP address:\
192.168.4.50\
Normal maintenance does not require opening the enclosure or connecting a USB cable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Development Environment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Source Control\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Project source code and documentation are stored in GitHub.\
Typical workflow:\
git status\
git add .\
git commit -m "Description of changes"\
git push\
Firmware changes should always be committed to GitHub before deployment to the ESP32.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Connecting to the ESP32\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Verify Network Connectivity\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Before attempting a connection from Thonny, verify the ESP32 is reachable.\
Open Terminal:\
ping 192.168.4.50\
Expected result:\
64 bytes from 192.168.4.50\
If the controller does not respond to ping, verify power and Wi-Fi connectivity.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Verify WebREPL Operation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Thonny uses the MicroPython WebREPL service on port 8266.\
Before troubleshooting Thonny, verify that WebREPL is running.\
Open Terminal:\
nc -vz 192.168.4.50 8266\
Expected result:\
Connection to 192.168.4.50 port 8266 [tcp/*] succeeded!\
This confirms:\
